#Customer

###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/customers/
Accept: application/json

###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/customers/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    
    "customer_name": "Arjun",
    "phone": "9876533210",
    "email": "arjun@gmail.com",
    "place": "Kochi"

}

###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/customers/1/
Accept: application/json

###
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/customers/2/
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customer_name": "Arjun Updated",
    "phone": "9876533210",
    "email": "arjun@gmail.com",
    "place": "Kochi"
}

###
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/customers/2/

#Repair

###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/repairs/
Accept: application/json

###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/repairs/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customer": 3,
    "device_name": "Dell Laptop",
    "problem_description": "Battery not working",
    "repair_status": "Pending",
    "repair_charge": "4000.00"
}

###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/repairs/1/

###
